{"seq":3,"slug":"credit-policy-tier-governance","title":"信贷政策分层与例外审批治理：客户分层、条款矩阵与越权豁免控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/b2b-trade-credit-net-terms-underwriting-ar-collections/trade-credit-policy-model/credit-policy-tier-governance","wordCount":2769,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"信贷政策分层与例外审批治理-客户分层-条款矩阵与越权豁免控制\">信贷政策分层与例外审批治理：客户分层、条款矩阵与越权豁免控制</h1><p>跨境 B2B 交易里最常见的信贷事故不是&quot;某个客户赖账&quot;，而是&quot;某个业务员在旺季给一个 T4 客户签了 90 天账期、额度翻了三倍，全程没有人看见&quot;。这类事故的根因几乎从不是缺少政策文本，而是政策只写了一条&quot;原则上账期不超过 60 天&quot;，却没有定义<strong>分层</strong>（谁该拿什么条件）、<strong>矩阵</strong>（条件如何被唯一地推导出来）和<strong>例外通道</strong>（超出矩阵时谁有权批、批了之后留下什么痕迹）。本文讨论的是这套治理结构本身：如何把客户分成可计算的层、如何把层映射为条款矩阵、以及如何让&quot;越权豁免&quot;从影子操作变成一条有授权、有上限、有到期日、有台账的正规通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-政策层级-分层-矩阵与例外\">核心概念：政策层级、分层、矩阵与例外</h2><p>先把四个词固定下来，后续所有讨论都依赖它们。</p>\n<p><strong>信贷政策（credit policy）</strong> 是董事会或 CFO 层级批准的、规定&quot;公司愿意承担什么风险、由谁承担&quot;的稳定文件。它通常只包含原则、风险偏好（risk appetite）、禁止性条款与授权框架，<strong>不包含具体客户的额度数字</strong>——一旦政策里出现具体客户名，它就退化成了操作记录。</p>\n<p><strong>分层（tiering / segmentation）</strong> 是把客户按可量化的风险与经济贡献归入有限个离散层级（如 T1–T5）的过程。分层的价值在于把&quot;逐客户谈判&quot;变成&quot;逐层级复用&quot;：一百个 T3 客户共享同一套默认条款，例外才有讨论的必要。</p>\n<p><strong>条款矩阵（terms matrix）</strong> 是层级到商业条款的函数映射：给定层级、国家风险、订单规模，唯一地推导出账期（net terms）、额度上限算法、担保要求和复核周期。矩阵的意义是<strong>可预测性</strong>——同样的输入必须得到同样的输出，否则矩阵就只是装饰。</p>\n<p><strong>例外（exception / override）</strong> 是任何偏离矩阵默认值的行为，包括超额、超期、免担保、提前放货给新客户等。例外本身不是错误，错误是<strong>未经授权的例外</strong>（unauthorized override）与<strong>无记录的例外</strong>（undocumented override）。</p>\n<p>风险管理里预期损失的核心恒等式贯穿全文，它决定了分层和矩阵要为哪些变量负责：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EL = PD \\times LGD \\times EAD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为违约概率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LGD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为违约损失率（受担保与追偿能力影响）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EAD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为违约风险敞口（受额度与账期影响）。分层的本质是在降低并区分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>；矩阵的本质是在控制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EAD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LGD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>；例外审批的本质是阻止这三者被单方面放宽。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[客户主数据&lt;br/&gt;财务 征信 交易历史] --&gt; B[评分卡&lt;br/&gt;PD 估计]&#10;  B --&gt; C{评分带判定}&#10;  C --&gt;|高分组| D[准入分层 T1/T2]&#10;  C --&gt;|中间组| E[有条件分层 T3/T4]&#10;  C --&gt;|低分组| F[拒绝或仅预付]&#10;  D --&gt; G[条款矩阵&lt;br/&gt;账期 额度 担保]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{申请是否偏离矩阵}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[系统自动放行]&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[例外通道&lt;br/&gt;DoA 授权矩阵]&#10;  J --&gt;|授权内| K[限时豁免&lt;br/&gt;登记台账 到期复审]&#10;  J --&gt;|超授权| L[升级至更高级&lt;br/&gt;或直接拒绝]\">graph TD\n  A[客户主数据&lt;br/&gt;财务 征信 交易历史] --&gt; B[评分卡&lt;br/&gt;PD 估计]\n  B --&gt; C{评分带判定}\n  C --&gt;|高分组| D[准入分层 T1/T2]\n  C --&gt;|中间组| E[有条件分层 T3/T4]\n  C --&gt;|低分组| F[拒绝或仅预付]\n  D --&gt; G[条款矩阵&lt;br/&gt;账期 额度 担保]\n  E --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{申请是否偏离矩阵}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[系统自动放行]\n  H --&gt;|是| J[例外通道&lt;br/&gt;DoA 授权矩阵]\n  J --&gt;|授权内| K[限时豁免&lt;br/&gt;登记台账 到期复审]\n  J --&gt;|超授权| L[升级至更高级&lt;br/&gt;或直接拒绝]</pre><h2 id=\"客户分层-维度选择与评分带设计\">客户分层：维度选择与评分带设计</h2><p>分层的第一原则是<strong>维度必须与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 相关，而不是与讲解的方便性相关</strong>。实践中被验证有效的维度分四类，缺一类都会产生系统性偏差。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度类别</th>\n<th>典型变量</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>主要影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>偿债能力</td>\n<td>流动比率、EBITDA/利息、净资产</td>\n<td>经审计财报、买方自填</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付行为</td>\n<td>历史逾期天数、DSO、争议票据占比</td>\n<td>自家 AR 台账</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EAD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部征信</td>\n<td>商业信用评分、破产预测分、法院/失信记录</td>\n<td>邓白氏（Dun &amp; Bradstreet）PAYDEX 与 Failure Score、Creditsafe、Moody&#39;s Analytics RiskCalc、S&amp;P Global 企业评分</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构性风险</td>\n<td>国家/地区风险、行业景气、单一客户集中度、关联方占比</td>\n<td>内部合规库、信用保险商国别评级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LGD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>北美信贷管理界长期把邓白氏 PAYDEX 作为行为分基准，其量表以 80 分代表&quot;按期付款&quot;；欧洲信用保险商（Allianz Trade、Atradius、Coface）则习惯以自有的买方评级与国家评级组合决定承保上限。跨境场景下必须<strong>同时</strong>引入国别与制裁筛查维度——一个国家风险等级跳升时，该国全部客户的层级应被批量重估，而不是等每个客户各自违约。</p>\n<p>分层的量化落点是评分卡。信用风险通用的评分标尺把概率映射为分数，使&quot;分数每降 N 分，违约几率翻倍&quot;成为可配置的业务语言：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>O</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Score = Offset + Factor \\times \\ln(Odds),\\quad Factor = \\frac{PDO}{\\ln 2},\\quad Offset = BaseScore - Factor \\times \\ln(BaseOdds)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">dd</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">dd</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PDO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>（points to double the odds）是&quot;几率翻倍所需的分数&quot;，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BaseScore</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BaseOdds</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">dd</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是标尺锚点。这套变换被广泛用于征信评分体系，其好处是分层边界可以用&quot;分数带&quot;而非&quot;概率区间&quot;来写，业务方更容易沟通。</p>\n<p>分层落地的常见缺陷是把层级数量设得过多。<strong>五层是可维护的上限</strong>：T1（战略/低风险）到 T5（高风险/仅预付），再加一条&quot;拒绝&quot;。层级越多，每一层的样本越少，回头检验统计功效越差，维护成本反而超过收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条款矩阵-从层级到账期-额度与担保\">条款矩阵：从层级到账期、额度与担保</h2><p>矩阵要回答三个问题，且答案必须能被同一条规则复现。</p>\n<p><strong>账期（net terms）</strong> 由层级与国别共同决定，并受法律上限约束。欧盟《迟付款指令》2011/7/EU 规定企业对企业的付款期原则上不超过 60 天；欧盟 2023 年提出以《迟付款条例》提案 COM(2023) 533 取代该指令，拟将上限收紧至 30 天，截至 2025 年仍在立法程序中。跨境矩阵必须把这类法定上限写成硬约束，而不是让业务在合同里&quot;协商&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>额度上限</strong> 用与经济规模挂钩的公式表达，而不是拍一个绝对值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>月均采购额</mtext><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 净资产</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Limit = k_{tier} \\times \\min(\\text{月均采购额} \\times L_{months},\\ \\text{净资产} \\times \\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">imi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月均采购额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净资产</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{months}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该层允许的最大&quot;月采购额倍数&quot;，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 是净资产敞口比率上限。这样即使客户突然放量，额度也会自动随基数增长但受第二项封顶。</p>\n<p><strong>担保要求</strong> 直接作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LGD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>：T1/T2 可无担保；T3 起要求部分预付、备用信用证（SBLC）或母公司担保；T4 要求全额预付或银行保函；T5 仅预付。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>账期上限</th>\n<th>额度上限</th>\n<th>担保/信用保险</th>\n<th>复核周期</th>\n<th>典型占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>T1 战略低风险</td>\n<td>Net 60–90</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 月采购额</td>\n<td>无（可选投保）</td>\n<td>年度</td>\n<td>5–10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T2 优质</td>\n<td>Net 45–60</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 月采购额</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>半年</td>\n<td>15–25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T3 标准</td>\n<td>Net 30–45</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 月采购额</td>\n<td>信用保险或部分预付</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>35–50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T4 关注</td>\n<td>Net 15–30</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 月采购额</td>\n<td>母公司担保或保函</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n<td>10–20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T5 高风险</td>\n<td>预付</td>\n<td>单笔审批</td>\n<td>全额预付/现金</td>\n<td>每笔</td>\n<td>&lt;5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵必须<strong>机器可执行</strong>：它应该是一张能被 ERP/信贷系统读取的表，而不是 Word 里的描述。判断矩阵是否真的在运行，有个简单测试——随机抽十个新客户，看其额度与账期是否可由矩阵中的规则唯一复现。若不能，说明业务在系统外谈判，控制已失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"例外审批与授权-doa-矩阵与越权豁免控制\">例外审批与授权：DoA 矩阵与越权豁免控制</h2><p>例外的治理不是&quot;禁止例外&quot;，而是让例外<strong>可见、可授权、可到期</strong>。四类例外需要被显式建模：超额（over-limit）、超期（extended terms）、免担保（waiver of security）、新客户先放货（early shipment to unrated buyer）。</p>\n<p>授权矩阵（Delegation of Authority, DoA）的核心是把&quot;金额 × 例外类型&quot;映射到审批层级，并强制<strong>双人原则</strong>（four-eyes principle）与<strong>职责分离</strong>（segregation of duties）——提出例外的销售不能同时是批准者，批准者也不能是账务处理者。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>例外规模（占该客户额度比例）</th>\n<th>最低审批层级</th>\n<th>附加控制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>≤10% 且 ≤ 10 万美元</td>\n<td>信贷经理</td>\n<td>单人审批，系统留痕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10–25%</td>\n<td>区域信贷总监</td>\n<td>四人眼原则，需风控会签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25–50%</td>\n<td>集团信贷总监 + CFO 委托人</td>\n<td>限时豁免，指定到期日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;50% 或涉及 T5 客户</td>\n<td>CFO / 董事会风险委员会</td>\n<td>逐笔记账，季度向委员会报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任何国别/制裁红线变更</td>\n<td>合规负责人一票否决</td>\n<td>不得由业务侧豁免</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>治理落地上有五条被反复验证的必要控制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>限时而非永久</strong>。例外必须带到期日（如 60 天或下一张订单），到期自动回落矩阵默认值，否则例外会沉淀成影子政策。</li>\n<li><strong>登记与编号</strong>。每笔例外进例外台账（exception register），含申请人、批准人、依据、金额、到期日、关闭状态。SOX 语境下&quot;管理层凌驾于控制之上&quot;（management override of controls）是审计的固有风险领域，PCAOB AS 2401 与 COSO《内部控制——整合框架》(2013) 都要求对这类超越有可测试的日志。</li>\n<li><strong>比率监控</strong>。例外率（例外笔数/总授信笔数）与例外金额占比是政策健康度的主指标；同一批准人、同一客户的例外重复率过高，说明矩阵本身错了，而不是执行错了。</li>\n<li><strong>回测与校准</strong>。按层统计实际违约率与评分带预测的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 偏差，偏差超阈值即触发重新划分评分带，而不是收紧审批。</li>\n<li><strong>可回滚的降级路径</strong>。客户层级下调、额度冻结、订单暂挂必须是系统内置动作，不应依赖人工邮件通知。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个常见的侥幸心理是&quot;旺季先放货，旺季过了再补审批&quot;。这恰恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EAD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 敞口最大的时点。正确做法是给旺季预设<strong>临时额度提升通道</strong>：事先批准一个上限、一个到期日、一个监控频率，把冲动决策转化为事前授权，避免事后补票。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>信贷政策分层与例外治理的产出不是一份更厚的制度文件，而是一组可执行的对象：一张可被系统读取的条款矩阵、一张金额到审批层级的 DoA 表、一本编号在册且带到期日的例外台账，以及若干条能反向检验政策本身的比率与回测指标。分层的价值在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 的差异转化为可复用的商业条件；矩阵的价值在于让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EAD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LGD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 不再由单次谈判决定；例外通道的价值在于承认风险偏好之外总有商业现实，但把它约束在授权、上限与时间之内。三者缺一，政策就只是文本；三者齐备，信贷才成为一个可计算、可审计、可校准的经营系统。关于授信额度本身的建模，见同章 <a href=\"./\">本章目录</a> 与下一章的 <a href=\"../business-underwriting-credit-limit/\">业务授信与额度模型</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"信贷政策分层与例外审批治理：客户分层、条款矩阵与越权豁免控制","id":"信贷政策分层与例外审批治理-客户分层-条款矩阵与越权豁免控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：政策层级、分层、矩阵与例外","id":"核心概念-政策层级-分层-矩阵与例外"},{"level":2,"text":"客户分层：维度选择与评分带设计","id":"客户分层-维度选择与评分带设计"},{"level":2,"text":"条款矩阵：从层级到账期、额度与担保","id":"条款矩阵-从层级到账期-额度与担保"},{"level":2,"text":"例外审批与授权：DoA 矩阵与越权豁免控制","id":"例外审批与授权-doa-矩阵与越权豁免控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"现金折扣与提前付款：2/10 NET 30 的年化成本测算与折扣政策设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/b2b-trade-credit-net-terms-underwriting-ar-collections/trade-credit-policy-model/cash-discount-early-payment"},"next":{"title":"征信报告与财务报表分析：D&B 评级、Altman Z-Score 与偿债能力评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/b2b-trade-credit-net-terms-underwriting-ar-collections/business-underwriting-credit-limit/credit-report-financial-analysis"}}